// # sec/crypto/symmetric/ — Symmetric Primitives
//
// Logline: SHA-256/SHA-512 hashes + HMAC-SHA-256 + constant-time primitives.
//
//
// Setup: Domain module. Caps and layout are in the parent ANCHOR.oo.
// Beats:
//   1. crypto.c — orchestrator: cap_attenuate / oo_cg_sign / oo_cg_verify (the cap-gated HMAC + cg primitives).
//   2. hash.c — SHA-256, SHA-512, sha256_bytes (used by HMAC).
//   3. hmac.c — HMAC-SHA-256 (used by cap_seal).
//   4. secure.c — secure_wipe + constant-time compare (ct_cmp).
//
// v3.1.0 file split + audit cleanup: the original 445-line crypto.c
// was split into the symmetric/ subdir (4 files). The v3.1.0 audit
// also removed the 6 dead json_*_internal and python_embed_internal
// functions (~90 lines) from crypto.c; only the live cg_sign HMAC
// public surface remains.
//
// ──▓▓ sec/crypto/symmetric ANCHOR ──▓▓──
// :: constant-time primitives + secure_wipe on free ::
